# Chained NWM Retrospective v3.0 run on VPU 03W: 24 h of hourly retro CHRTOUT forcing, 288 steps,
# restart from the retro file valid at START_TIME. Retro covers 1979-02-01 01:00 .. 2023-02-01 00:00.
# Needs routing-comparison with FORECAST_TYPE 12 (long-runs branch) and t-route with the
# multi-loop feather DA fix (feather-da-multiloop).
DESCRIPTION="VPU 03W, chained retro v3.0, 24 h"
VPU=${VPU:-03W}
FORECAST_TYPE=${FORECAST_TYPE:-12}
RUN_HOURS=${RUN_HOURS:-24}
MAX_LOOP_SIZE=${MAX_LOOP_SIZE:-24}
START_TIME=${START_TIME:-202204300000}
CYCLES=${CYCLES:-1}
CYCLE_STEP_H=${CYCLE_STEP_H:-24}
N_CPUS=${N_CPUS:-8}
# Long windows: USGS requests scale with rows (50k per page), so chunk 40 saves nothing and
# a year at 40 sites per request exceeds hydrotools' 20-page cap (data silently dropped).
# Set here because .env's VM default (40) applies only when USGS_CHUNK is still empty.
USGS_CHUNK=${USGS_CHUNK:-5}
